          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a m’i kindwu m’ulworo Yehova, m’uworo dwand jatic pare? ng’atu m’uwotho i mudho, man der umbe kude, wek egen nying’ Yehova, man ejeng’ kum Mungu pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, kewu ceke ma wucwinyo mac, ma wutwiru giwu ku dhumac; wuwoth i lebmac mi mac mu, man kind dhumac ma wucwinyo. Wubibedo ku maeni m’i cinga; wubivuto piny i can.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
